     2,
     1,
     3
    ]
   ],
   "about": "Down-back, down and down-forward + a button are the same crouching normal, unless the character has a command normal there (e.g. Chun-Li's 3HK).",
   "source": {
    "verified": true,
    "note": "SuperCombo Wiki, Street Fighter 6 Data pages (patch 2.05), read 2026-10-14 (normals are listed as 2X; 1X/3X only as command normals)"
